  /* List grid: 1 col mobile (all items stack as one continuous list,
     matching the source's #brxe-ddqmnk mobile pattern) / 2 sub-cols
     desktop (4 left + 5 right, matching #brxe-jwolrh + #brxe-toitaz). */
